        "text": "Page: Jonny Craig. Sentence: Jonathan Monroe \"Jonny\" Craig (born March 26, 1986) is a Canadian-American singer and songwriter.\nPage: Jonny Craig. Sentence: He has been the lead vocalist for the bands Dance Gavin Dance, Emarosa, Ghost Runner on Third, Slaves, and westerHALTS.\nPage: Pete Doherty. Sentence: He is best known for being co-frontman of the Libertines, which he formed with Carl Barât in 1997.\nPage: Pete Doherty. Sentence: His other musical projects are indie band Babyshambles and Peter Doherty and the Puta Madres.\nPage: The Greatest of All Lost Arts. Sentence: The album contains 11 tracks, with Jonny Craig providing guest vocals on \"Pueblo Cicada\".\nPage: The Last of the English Roses. Sentence: “Last of the English Roses” is the debut solo single by Peter Doherty.",
